                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00471/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00450/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台手机，型号未知，系统未知，当有人在使用它超过2小时之后，眼睛会剧烈疼痛，并且此现象会持续20秒，之后使用者的视力会成为5.0，并且永远不会改变。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市██街<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>魏██研究员的抽屉里<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>谁██的能告诉我，为啥我视力是5.2现在却成了5.0了？！姓魏的我要杀了你啊！<br />
-██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00450" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00450" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00450-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sertay" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6605732); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6605732&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606206660" alt="sertay" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6605732)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sertay" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6605732); return false;">sertay</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1603343321 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Oct 2020 05:08</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00419/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">项目描述</span>：</strong>一副由<span style="font-size:x-large;">████公司</span>生产的<span style="font-size:x-large;">███眼镜</span>，会使<span style="font-size:x-large;">佩戴者</span>认为其所看到的<span style="font-size:x-large;">文字</span>中的<span style="font-size:x-large;">名词部分</span>比<span style="font-size:x-large;">其他部分</span>要大一些。<br />
<strong>回收<span style="font-size:x-large;">日期</span>：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收<span style="font-size:x-large;">地点</span>：</strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">████公司专卖店</span>。<br />
<strong>当前<span style="font-size:x-large;">状态</span>：</strong>存放于Dr.K的<span style="font-size:x-large;">办公室</span>内。<br />
<strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">笔记</span>：</strong><em>确实是大<strong>亿</strong>些。&#8212;Dr.K</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00419" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00419" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00419-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606206660" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601610342 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Oct 2020 03:45</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00240/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>该项目是是一把工作用椅。使用该项目工作效率会逐渐提升，但在工作完成后将昏睡4.05倍的使用时间<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存在Site-CN-█低危异常收容柜内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>当我用完才知道这个██的工作椅下面写着：时间贷，特惠就收1%的利息。真██。——特工██</p>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00240" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00240" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00240-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dead-wood240" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6243991); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6243991&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606206660" alt="Dead wood240" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6243991)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dead-wood240" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6243991); return false;">Dead wood240</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591430833 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Jun 2020 08:07</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块型号不明的手机电池，当所处空间温度超过30℃时，该项目会迅速膨胀到汽车安全气囊的大小。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site23东侧的手机修理店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site23的低风险异常项目仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“一名女士跟我说手机的安全气囊弹出来了，当时我还不信。”——潜伏于手机修理店的邢特工</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00278" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00278-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4136896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606206660" alt="Ginger249-Jackie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4136896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;">Ginger249-Jackie</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592710114 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">21 Jun 2020 03:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00213/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块黑板擦，任何被项目所接触的字迹都会变得无法被擦除<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市███初级中学<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这是和那块黑板配套的吗？</em>——特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
